      "message": "I initially had this call `changeZoomLevel` which also works but I like the zoom to be centered at the mouse cursor position. Let me know if this should achieved without (somewhat abusing) the gesture handler, perhaps with a dedicated transform.\n\nOn Mac, NSEvent has a `momentumPhase` property (https://developer.apple.com/documentation/appkit/nsevent/1525439-momentumphase?language\u003dobjc) with clear `NSEventPhaseBegan`/`NSEventPhaseEnded` values that mark the begin/end of a trackpad gesture (which can map to startZoom/endZoom) but I don\u0027t know if those get reported with a mouse wheel and I don\u0027t think they have equivalents on Windows/Unix.",
